    host deals one enabled entry per match). A searched course: its rails prefab carries the
    whole RegattaCourseGenome (circuit, braid, features, placements), the one the real-game
    judge raced. Wide search shard_cloud1-2240: Spherene world, super-shielded 41%, rails on
    26% of the lap, no nucleus, lifeforms Rampage Cell/Rampage Cell Config 3, lap 6467 u.
    Field spread {''card'': 2.586, ''L5'': 3.514} (3 seeds, real-game judge). 4159 prisms
    measured; PhaseThresholds ride that count at the rail prism''s nominal volume plus a
    trail band. Flora and fauna: Rampage Cell/Rampage Cell Config 3''s spawn profile.
    Regenerate with Tools/Build/author_regatta_assets.py from
    Tools/Build/regatta_shuffle_pool.json, never by hand.'
